  "schema:description": "This is one out of 165 recordings done in the DGS-Korpus project (http://dgs-korpus.de) from 2010 to 2012 to collect a corpus of DGS (German Sign Language). The recording took place on 2011-10-28, the informants are from our data collection region Cologne (North Rhine, partially Rhineland-Palatinate). This movie contains the following tracks:10:10:20:40-11:52:35:30 DGS-Korpus-A1_20111028T1000.mov 720p50 A1 (frontal view of informant A)12:22:50:43-13:35:31:17 DGS-Korpus-A1_20111028T1200.mov 720p50 A1 (frontal view of informant A)14:39:35:44-16:04:28:24 DGS-Korpus-A1_20111028T1400.mov 720p50 A1 (frontal view of informant A)16:21:37:28-17:12:28:39 DGS-Korpus-A1_20111028T1600.mov 720p50 A1 (frontal view of informant A)10:10:18:01-11:52:45:37 DGS-Korpus-A2_20111028T1000.mov 1080i25 A2 (bird’s eye view of informant A)12:22:25:17-13:35:41:27 DGS-Korpus-A2_20111028T1200.mov 1080i25 A2 (bird’s eye view of informant A)14:39:36:34-16:04:36:44 DGS-Korpus-A2_20111028T1400.mov 1080i25 A2 (bird’s eye view of informant A)16:21:38:16-17:12:37:38 DGS-Korpus-A2_20111028T1600.mov 1080i25 A2 (bird’s eye view of informant A)10:10:33:13-11:52:58:21 DGS-Korpus-A4L_20111028T1000.mov 1080i25 A4L (left channel of a stereoscopic frontal view of informant A (Panasonic camera))12:23:04:06-13:35:53:18 DGS-Korpus-A4L_20111028T1200.mov 1080i25 A4L (left channel of a stereoscopic frontal view of informant A (Panasonic camera))14:39:50:31-16:04:47:49 DGS-Korpus-A4L_20111028T1400.mov 1080i25 A4L (left channel of a stereoscopic frontal view of informant A (Panasonic camera))16:21:51:23-17:12:49:23 DGS-Korpus-A4L_20111028T1600.mov 1080i25 A4L (left channel of a stereoscopic frontal view of informant A (Panasonic camera))10:10:33:13-11:52:58:21 DGS-Korpus-A4R_20111028T1000.mov 1080i25 A4R (right channel of a stereoscopic frontal view of informant A (Panasonic camera))12:23:04:06-13:35:53:18 DGS-Korpus-A4R_20111028T1200.mov 1080i25 A4R (right channel of a stereoscopic frontal view of informant A (Panasonic camera))14:39:50:31-16:04:47:49 DGS-Korpus-A4R_20111028T1400.mov 1080i25 A4R (right channel of a stereoscopic frontal view of informant A (Panasonic camera))16:21:51:23-17:12:49:23 DGS-Korpus-A4R_20111028T1600.mov 1080i25 A4R (right channel of a stereoscopic frontal view of informant A (Panasonic camera))10:10:19:39-11:52:31:03 DGS-Korpus-B1_20111028T1000.mov 720p50 B1 (frontal view of informant A)12:22:43:39-13:35:26:02 DGS-Korpus-B1_20111028T1200.mov 720p50 B1 (frontal view of informant A)14:39:42:00-16:04:24:20 DGS-Korpus-B1_20111028T1400.mov 720p50 B1 (frontal view of informant A)16:21:30:24-17:12:23:40 DGS-Korpus-B1_20111028T1600.mov 720p50 B1 (frontal view of informant A)10:10:11:42-11:52:40:04 DGS-Korpus-B2_20111028T1000.mov 1080i25 B2 (bird’s eye view of informant A)12:22:45:06-13:35:36:10 DGS-Korpus-B2_20111028T1200.mov 1080i25 B2 (bird’s eye view of informant A)14:39:31:16-16:04:32:38 DGS-Korpus-B2_20111028T1400.mov 1080i25 B2 (bird’s eye view of informant A)16:21:31:47-17:12:33:13 DGS-Korpus-B2_20111028T1600.mov 1080i25 B2 (bird’s eye view of informant A)10:10:28:03-11:52:51:47 DGS-Korpus-B4L_20111028T1000.mov 1080i25 B4L (left channel of a stereoscopic frontal view of informant B (Panasonic camera))12:22:56:48-13:35:47:24 DGS-Korpus-B4L_20111028T1200.mov 1080i25 B4L (left channel of a stereoscopic frontal view of informant B (Panasonic camera))14:39:44:27-16:04:41:25 DGS-Korpus-B4L_20111028T1400.mov 1080i25 B4L (left channel of a stereoscopic frontal view of informant B (Panasonic camera))16:21:46:09-17:12:42:45 DGS-Korpus-B4L_20111028T1600.mov 1080i25 B4L (left channel of a stereoscopic frontal view of informant B (Panasonic camera))10:10:28:03-11:52:51:47 DGS-Korpus-B4R_20111028T1000.mov 1080i25 B4R (right channel of a stereoscopic frontal view of informant B (Panasonic camera))12:22:56:48-13:35:47:24 DGS-Korpus-B4R_20111028T1200.mov 1080i25 B4R (right channel of a stereoscopic frontal view of informant B (Panasonic camera))1